  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/801",
  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2befaa41be7a09516298ef98ed6c98524b8478d4?download\" data-file-name=\"빛의 특징.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"263290\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DF1n%26dataid%3D801%26fileid%3D17%26regdt%3D20241031170129&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F2befaa41be7a09516298ef98ed6c98524b8478d4')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">빛의 특징</span><span class=\"type\">.hwpx</span></div><div class=\"size\">257.12KB</div></div></a></div><p>김신혜 선생님이 수업 아이디어와 전화영 선생님의 수업 아이디어 등등 조합하여 부스 운영을 해봐야겠다 싶어서 만든 자료와 운영팁입니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>아이들이 관심을 갖게 하는 게 필요하여 귀!엽!게! 만들기 위해 검색 엄청 했습니다. 하실 분은 쉽게 아래 링크를 클릭하셔서 구매하시면 도움이 되실 것 같아 올립니다. ^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>교내 자율 동아리 활동을 하면서 빛에 대해 알아보기 활동을 하며&#160;</p><p>1。 활동지로 빛의 특징 조사하기 （학생들에게 검색하며 정리해보게 시키고 발표하는 시간을 가졌습니다。）&#160;&#160;</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;활동지 간단하게 만들었습니다。 파일 올려두었습니다。 참고하실 분은 쓰세요~&#160;</p><p>2。 편광필름을 이용하여 스테인드글라스 만들기（편광 ）&#160;</p><p>3。 홀로스펙스 필름、 회절필름을 이용하여 회절과 간섭 현상 알아보기 （빛의 파동성）&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>동아리 활동 후 부스 운영 준비했습니다。&#160;</p><p>인당 1500원 정도 예산이 들지 싶습니다~&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>부스 운영 안내 자료로 만든 내용입니다~&#160;</p><p>용량이 커서 드라이브에 올렸습니다。&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qDpJUf0lFXF1wijn6rTf_WlU_0RzxGnL/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qDpJUf0lFXF1wijn6rTf_WlU_0RzxGnL/view?usp=sharing</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"빛으로의 환상여행(상안중_이계영).pdf\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"drive.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qDpJUf0lFXF1wijn6rTf_WlU_0RzxGnL/view?usp=sharing\" data-og-url=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qDpJUf0lFXF1wijn6rTf_WlU_0RzxGnL/view?usp=sharing&amp;usp=embed_facebook\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qDpJUf0lFXF1wijn6rTf_WlU_0RzxGnL/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qDpJUf0lFXF1wijn6rTf_WlU_0RzxGnL/view?usp=sharing\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">빛으로의 환상여행(상안중_이계영).pdf</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">drive.google.com</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>책갈피로 사용하게 앞면은 깔끔하게 하기 위해 뒷면에 이름을 씁니다。&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"floatLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddbdb8d3d2e401e7fb6ac7fea4c322c5b6872e4b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"275\" height=\"367\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddbdb8d3d2e401e7fb6ac7fea4c322c5b6872e4b\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p>책갈피와 끈 세트가 있어서 같이 구매했습니다。&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"floatLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bedf5e4eaa0b182dcd1d50075401dac6e13cb1ea\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"271\" height=\"361\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bedf5e4eaa0b182dcd1d50075401dac6e13cb1ea\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"floatLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4062e32e33cb2e758677c7271a43143fbf3edaab\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"280\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4062e32e33cb2e758677c7271a43143fbf3edaab\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"><div class=\"figcaption\">LED 크리스마스 트리 조명</div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ed602ac23cc2cad3db6feb7909b208d31c52b60\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ed602ac23cc2cad3db6feb7909b208d31c52b60\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"><div class=\"figcaption\">다양한 피규어를 준비했습니다。</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c4ddca100c8f428eba81845d898ac2b5ef4922d5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"295\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c4ddca100c8f428eba81845d898ac2b5ef4922d5\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"><div class=\"figcaption\">링라벨 스티커</div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/303062e566ddc6362a7853692c69f77e0e358316\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"320\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/303062e566ddc6362a7853692c69f77e0e358316\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"><div class=\"figcaption\">눈꽃 스티커도 컵 꾸미라고 주면 좋긴 해요。 비싸서 조금만 샀습니다。</div></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f5cf1ceecfb5cd136f6ac1bfc5934c69e20795f9\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"350\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f5cf1ceecfb5cd136f6ac1bfc5934c69e20795f9\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"4000\"><div class=\"figcaption\">피규어를 컵에 붙이는 용도로 도톰한 양면 테이프 쓰면 좋아요。</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e5bcc5df79f7d1eac6e2d70e65ad40f08521aa70\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"549\" height=\"412\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e5bcc5df79f7d1eac6e2d70e65ad40f08521aa70\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"2250\"><div class=\"figcaption\">입구에서 필름으로 관찰하고 들어오면 만들기 체험을 할 수 있게 꾸몄습니다。 동아리 학생들과 만들기 할 때는 와인병에 조명을 넣어서 만들었어요</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/96dd442dc62d81edd39ed567833407134478f75b\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"555\" height=\"416\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/96dd442dc62d81edd39ed567833407134478f75b\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"2250\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1cd9d7f0b14e317174fa6c72e60d4e91d55f51c7\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"548\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1cd9d7f0b14e317174fa6c72e60d4e91d55f51c7\" data-origin-width=\"2250\" data-origin-height=\"1260\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d1f17db35deaac17c0bbb010b74341b8851d9d0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"540\" height=\"405\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4d1f17db35deaac17c0bbb010b74341b8851d9d0\" data-origin-width=\"3000\" data-origin-height=\"2250\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/310250ed25f16beb22afa57c9f86f913eebfce49\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/310250ed25f16beb22afa57c9f86f913eebfce49\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"><div class=\"figcaption\">조명등 만들면 요런 모습~</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5fc4d8ffe8f47ee9d4e9655e3f9bc08565e38b0\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"393\" height=\"295\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d5fc4d8ffe8f47ee9d4e9655e3f9bc08565e38b0\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"><div class=\"figcaption\">휴대폰에 필름 대고 찍었어요~ 사랑표</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f50b5950ba722528ec680594d2c61de1e809330\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/1f50b5950ba722528ec680594d2c61de1e809330\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"><div class=\"figcaption\">스마일</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7bb642d18c3ea839777734d319fd95a09d9f147\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7bb642d18c3ea839777734d319fd95a09d9f147\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"><div class=\"figcaption\">꽃모양</div></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf9708b2e1ca5213dbca9c77bf625203b6214438\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bf9708b2e1ca5213dbca9c77bf625203b6214438\" data-origin-width=\"4000\" data-origin-height=\"3000\"><div class=\"figcaption\">스파크</div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>* 구매 링크입니다。 개인적인 어떤 관련성도 없습니다~ 참고하세요~&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>[LED 와이어 무드등 크리스마스 트리 조명] 레인보우 색상, 580원</p><p><a href=\"https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=1962193205\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=1962193205</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>[고양이 책갈피 세트] 20장 세트, 2800원</p><p><a href=\"https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=2940166956\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=2940166956</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>[양면테이프] 40개입, 1600원</p><p><a href=\"https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=1652857372\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=1652857372</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>[투명과일컵 9온스, 돔막힘뚜껑포함] 100개입, 15000원</p><p><a href=\"https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=3910767668\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=3910767668</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>[미니어처 트리나무 소] 480원</p><p><a href=\"https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=3299452159\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=3299452159</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>[크리스마스 소품 장식 미니어처] 500원 (눈사람, 루돌프, 트리, 등등 종류별로 구매)</p><p><a href=\"https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=2667569725\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=2667569725</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>[홀로스펙스필름] 10장입 , 22000원 , 눈결정, 스마일, 하트, 스파크, 꽃 (5종류를 사면 전교생 사용 가능합니다)</p><p><a href=\"https://handoum.co.kr/goods/view?no=1765\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://handoum.co.kr/goods/view?no=1765</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>[링라벨] 7매입, 1070원 (4개 구멍을 사용할 경우 1매에 12명 사용 가능, 7*12=84명 가능)</p><p><a href=\"https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=1947788415&amp;buyboxtype=ad\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://item.gmarket.co.kr/Item?goodscode=1947788415&amp;buyboxtype=ad</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
